s  that I've really to Wharf the gate which  is placed quite a bit to the back of it  but yeah this is really quite a simple  building now I find that a clockwork  piece which I wasn't really too sure  what you use it for but I did want to  use it in something since it it's a  really beautiful piece so I ended up  going with this building since it's very  simple and sort of changed the color  scheme to match a bit with the colors of  that clock thing and that's basically  everything that this building has going  for it aside from the clock  it's just walls with a roof and windows  which is basically any building but this  one's a bit more simple it also doesn't  really have any function  it's just that fancy thing that sort of  sits right next to the big entrance  gates and I put those same roof pieces  on top of it just to make it fit in a  little bit better but also because I  really love those roof pieces they  really just make any kind of spire  fancier just by putting that let golden  little top piece on top of it which you  can actually use swords for as well but  that's something which I'll get into  later on anyway the very last building  of this entrance Plaza and this is once  again a bit of an importance building it  is the way that it's it's sort of is  setup is that the building in the middle  which is the big entrance is like the  most important thing that so that really  has to come out the most but these there  are going to be two corner buildings on  both sides with one tower at the end to  sort of mark the end of these rows and I  wanted to put quite a bit of work into  these things as well now this building  I'm not really sure if it has any kind  of style I always feel it's  a little bit russian almost in the way  that it's set up and laid out but aside  from that it doesn't really have many  details that would say so at all and not  really sure what exactly the style of  this would be I just thought it would  fit in the way that it is so that's 